Devil's advocate downgrade (1 test):
- DA strength 70 (downgrade_one_tier) → TAKE_NOW becomes WAIT_FOR_LEVEL

Robustness (2 tests):
- DA Opus call failure does NOT abort run (proceeds with pre-DA verdict)
- Individual Wave A agent failure does NOT abort (abstain penalty applied)

